      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1066580368,
      "customData": {
        "title": "Live demonstration",
        "spoken": "I'll now show the four steps. First, the gate has already downloaded the event details, and I'll disconnect it. Next, I'll scan a valid ticket and see whether the gate accepts it. Then I'll scan the same ticket again. This time, it should be rejected because it was already used. Finally, I'll reconnect the gate so its saved entry record can be sent back. I'll explain what actually happens, rather than just what I expected to happen.",
        "keyPoints": "1. Prepare and disconnect.\n2. First scan: check actual result.\n3. Second scan: check reuse is blocked.\n4. Reconnect and check saved record.",
        "originalSlideText": "DEMO\nFour steps to demonstrate offline entry.\nThese are demo steps — not a substitute for saved test data.\nPrivate Pass  /  MANAV CODATY\n13\n01\nPREPARE\nDownload event data, then disconnect.\n02\nSCAN ONCE\nA valid pass should be accepted.\n03\nSCAN AGAIN\nThe same pass should be rejected.\n04\nRECONNECT\nSaved entry records should sync.\nREHEARSE AND RECORD WHAT ACTUALLY HAPPENS",
        "sources": [
          "/Users/manavcodaty/Library/Mobile Documents/com~apple~CloudDocs/Praco Family/EPQ/Mav/PrivatePass_EPQ Presentation_v4.pptx — slide 14"
        ],
        "claim": "Live demonstration"
      },
      "index": "b1v",
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793173192618,
      "link": null
    },
